### Home route
GET http://localhost:3000

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get one contact by id
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/69f62a30b6f92e1af2d05558

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rebecca",
  "lastName": "Hanks",
  "email": "rebecca@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Purple",
  "birthday": "1998-01-01"
}


### Update a contact by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/69ffac948e272b262dcea3ee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rebecca",
  "lastName": "Hanks",
  "email": "rebecca.updated@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1998-01-01"
}


### Delete a contact by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/69ffac948e272b262dcea3ee